            "detailed_description": "<strong>New</strong> Tower. <strong>Old</strong> Enemy. Ride the vaporwaves in the 3rd instalment of the Big Tower Tiny Square series!<br><br>Inspired by 90s arcades, the Big NEON Tower is one giant level broken up into large single-screen sections. Each obstacle has been meticulously placed. Each section devilishly designed. It will take patience and skill to navigate the maze-like tower. Precision is key to success!<br><br>This 3rd instalment of the Big Tower Tiny Square series includes:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Story Mode ( ~ 2 hours of content)<br></li><li>Steam Achievements <br></li><li>Controller Support<br></li><li>Rad 90s Aesthetic<br></li><li>Kickass Soundtrack</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/758010/extras/d6f8f6be9195b8a5a5bac4be02527fe6.poster.avif?t=1732076374\" width=396 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/758010/extras/d6f8f6be9195b8a5a5bac4be02527fe6.webm?t=1732076374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/758010/extras/d6f8f6be9195b8a5a5bac4be02527fe6.mp4?t=1732076374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
